<span style="white-space:nowrap; display:block; padding:3px; background-color: #fff; text-align:center; color: #444; font-size:1.3em">
<% __('Mass Spectrometry-based Proteomics Workshop') |h %>
</span>

<center><p><strong>April 3rd &amp; 4th, 2012</strong></p></center>

<center><p><em><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Supported by {program}'), program => 'NSF Plant Genome Program' &><br />
Instruction: Drs. Jocelyn Rose and Ted Thannhauser and Sheng Zhang<br />
<& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Location: {facility}'), facility => 'Cornell Proteomics &amp; Mass Spectrometry Core Facility' &></em></p></center>

<p><% __('We had another extremely successful Proteomics Workshop this year that was highly oversubscribed. The workshop comprised both lectures and practical lab-based training in proteomic analysis, using advanced mass spectrometry techniques and bioinformatics and was targeted towards undergraduate and graduate students.  Based on the positive and enthusiastic feedback, a similar course will be offered next year.') |h %></p>

<p><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('{link}Handouts from the workshop{end_link} {format}'), link => '<a href="/documents/secretom/MSOct09WorkshopHandouts.pdf">', end_link => '</a>', format => '[pdf]' &></p>
<p><a href="#schedule"><% __('Schedule') |h %></a></p>
<p><a href="#photos"><% __('Photos from this year\'s workshop') |h %></a></p>

<center><img src="/documents/img/secretom/spectrometer1.png" /><img src="/documents/img/secretom/spectrometer2.png" /></center>

<br /><br /><br />

<p><center><strong><a name="schedule"><% __('SCHEDULE') |h %></a></strong></center></p>

<p><strong>April 3rd:</strong></p>
<p><strong>8:00am - 8:30am: Registration (badge, program handouts, breakfast</strong>) in room 130</p>
<p><strong>8:30am - 8:35am </strong>in room 130:</p>
<ol type="1">
<li><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('{strong}Program introduction{end_strong} by Professor {person1}'), person1 => 'Joss Rose', strong => '<strong>', end_strong => '</strong>' &></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>8:35am - 10:00am</strong> in room 141:</p>
<ol type="1" start="2">
<li><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('{strong}Experimental 1:{end_strong} Protein denaturing, reduction and alkylation of crude cell extract samples for shotgun proteomics analysis. (Attendees divided into 4 groups)'), strong => '<strong>', end_strong => '</strong>' &></li>
</ol>
<ul>Instructors: Huiming Yan (bench 1), Yong Yang (bench 2), Bob Sherwood (bench 3) and Celeste Ptak (bench 4).</ul>
<p><strong>10:20am - 11:20am</strong> in room 130 </p>
<ol type="1" start="3">
<li><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('{strong}Lecture 1 Presentation: {end_strong} Sample preparation and separation prior to MS analysis by Dr. {person1}'), person1 => 'Ted Thannhauser', strong => '<strong>', end_strong => '</strong>' &></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>11:30am - 12:00pm</strong> in room 141:</p>
<ol type="1" start="4">
<li><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('{strong}Experimental 2: {end_strong} in solution trypsin digestion.'), strong => '<strong>', end_strong => '</strong>' &></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>12:00pm - 1:00pm </strong> in room 130<strong>: </strong>Lunch and Break</p>
<p><strong>1:00pm - 2:15pm</strong> in room 130:</p>
<ol type="1" start="5">
<li><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('{strong}Lecture 2 Presentation: {end_strong} MS instrument fundamentals and Applications: (proteomics case studies) by Dr. {person1}'), person1 => 'Sheng Zhang', strong => '<strong>', end_strong => '</strong>' &></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>2:30pm - 3:30pm</strong> in room 143:</p>
<ol type="1" start="6">
<li><strong>Experimental 3: </strong> Lab tour and demo, split into 3 groups (20 min/rotation)</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<ul type="DISC">
<li><% __('nanoLC-MS/MS for iTRAQ samples in 4000 Q Trap: by Dr. Celeste Ptak') |h %></li>
<li><% __('MALDI-TOF/TOF analysis for 2D gel-based protein IDs: by Bob Sherwood') |h %></li>
<li><% __('NanoLC-MS/MS analysis for 1D gel bands: by Kevin Howe') |h %></li>
</ul>
</ul>
<p><strong>4:00pm - 5:00pm: </strong></p>
<ol type="1" start="7">
<li><strong> Experimental 4:</strong> set up nanoLC-MS/MS overnight running for in-solution digested samples with 60-min gradient for each run.</li>
<ol type="a">
<li><% __('10 samples on 4000 Q Trap by Dr. Celeste Ptak') |h %></li>
<li><% __('10 samples on Synapt HDMS by Kevin Howe and Yong Yang') |h %></li>
</ol>
</ol>
<p><strong>April 4th:</strong></p>
<p><strong>8:00am - 8:30am: </strong> breakfast and laptop computer setup in room 130</p>
<p><strong>8:30am - 9:00am:</strong></p>
<ol type="1" start="8">
<li><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('{strong}Experimental 5:{end_strong} Database searching and file conversion for overnight LC-MS/MS files'), strong => '<strong>', end_strong => '</strong>' &></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<ol type="a">
<li><% __('Mascot Maemon search and wiff file conversion to TMP file by Dr. Celeste Ptak in room 130') |h %></li>
</ol>
<ol type="a" start="2">
<li><% __('PLGS 2.4-Mascot database search and generating PKL file by Yong Yang and Kevin Howe in room 143') |h %></li>
</ol>
</ul>
<p><strong>9:30am - 10:30am: </strong></p>
<ol type="1" start="9">
<li><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('{strong}Lecture 3 Presentation:{end_strong} Introduction to Mascot-based MS database search and data interpretation by Professor {person1}'), person1 => 'Joss Rose', strong => '<strong>', end_strong => '</strong>' &></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>10:30am - 10:45am:</strong> transfer PKL files and TMP files into individual laptop computers.</p>
<p><strong>10:45am - 11:15am: </strong>in room 130 and room 143</p>
<ol type="1" start="10">
<li><strong>Experimental 6: </strong> Practice for generating PKL files and TMP files. Instructors: Celeste Ptak for TMP files, Huiming Yan and Kevin Howe for PKL files.</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>12:00pm - 1:00pm </strong> in room 130<strong>: </strong>Lunch and Break</p>
<p><strong> 1:00pm - 3:00pm </strong>in room 130</p>
<ol type="1" start="11">
<li><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('{strong}Experimental 7: {end_strong} database search practice against either Mascot public search engine or in-house licensed search engine. Assistants: {person1}, {person2}, {person3} and {person4}.'), person1 => 'Celeste Ptak', person2 => 'Huiming Yan', person3 => 'Kevin Howe', person4 => 'Yong Yang', strong => '<strong>', end_strong => '</strong>' &></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>3:20pm - 4:00pm: </strong>in room 130</p>
<ol type="1" start="12">
<li><% __('Summary of the group results for shotgun analysis in 4000 Q Trap and Synapt HDMS. Summary of the iTRAQ demo results for quantitative proteomics by Sheng Zhang.') |h %></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>4:00pm - 5:00pm:</strong> in room 130</p>
<ol type="1" start="13">
<li><% __('Wrap-up comments, questions and suggestions') |h %></li>
</ol>

<br /><br /><br />


